{"title":"Lead","sourceTitle":"Lead/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Lead/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Blei (100% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lead\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Lead (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lead/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Plomo (15% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lead/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Plomb (90% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lead/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Свинец (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lead/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"铅 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lead/ja\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"鉛 (100% translated)\" lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">日本語</a></li></ul></div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Chumbo</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ingot-lead.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/ec/Ingot-lead.png/100px-Ingot-lead.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ec/Ingot-lead.png/150px-Ingot-lead.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ec/Ingot-lead.png/200px-Ingot-lead.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Fundível</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ponto de cheiro</b>\n</td>\n<td>327°C\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Requer contêiner</b>\n</td>\n<td>Sim\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saída</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ingot_mold\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ingot mold\">Lingoteira</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Valor de saída</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n<b>Chumbo</b> é um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal\">metal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal\" title=\"Metal\"> </a></span> obtido da fundição de minério de galena.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Criação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Criação</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Ligas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ligas</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>Veja também: <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ore_Deposits\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ore Deposits\">Depósitos de minério</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits\" title=\"Ore Deposits\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n<p>O chumbo é criado a partir do minério de galena. Galena pode ser encontrada como minério de superfície em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rock#Stone_Type_and_Use_Chart\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rock\">pedra sedimentar</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rock#Stone_Type_and_Use_Chart\" title=\"Rock\"> </a></span>, como blocos de minério ou pedaços de superfície.\n</p><p>Vinte pepitas de galena serão <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Casting#Smelting_Metal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Casting\">produzir</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Casting#Smelting_Metal\" title=\"Casting\"> </a></span> um lingote de chumbo. Devido ao seu baixo ponto de fusão, o chumbo pode ser fundido usando combustíveis de baixa temperatura, como <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Firewood\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Firewood\">lenha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Firewood\" title=\"Firewood\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Peat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Peat\">turfa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Peat\" title=\"Peat\"> </a></span>, em vez de combustíveis de temperatura mais alta, como <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Charcoal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Charcoal\">carvão vegetal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Charcoal\" title=\"Charcoal\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Coal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Coal\">carvão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Coal\" title=\"Coal\"> </a></span>, que são mais difíceis de obter.\n<a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Silver\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Silver\">Minério de prata nativa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Silver\" title=\"Silver\"> </a></span> também pode ser encontrado em galena.\n</p><p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>Lead é usado para criar <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/ingot\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/ingot\">lingotes de solda de chumbos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ingot\" title=\"Ingot\"> </a></span>, que é usado para criar <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Alcohol_Brewing#Solderbars\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Alcohol Brewing\">equipamento de destilação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Alcohol_Brewing#Solderbars\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Alcohol Brewing\"> </a></span>. É também um componente para fazer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Glass#Leaded_glass_pane\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Glass\">painéis de vidro com chumbo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Glass#Leaded_glass_pane\" title=\"Glass\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p>Lingotes de chumbo podem ser <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\">trabalhado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\"> </a></span> em uma bigorna sem serem aquecidos. No entanto, os únicos itens que podem ser fabricados desta forma são placas de chumbo com dois lingotes de chumbo.\n</p><p><br />\nPlacas de chumbo podem ser usadas para fazer:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Plaque\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Plaque\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b8/Plaque-fancy-copper-wall-north.png/25px-Plaque-fancy-copper-wall-north.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b8/Plaque-fancy-copper-wall-north.png/38px-Plaque-fancy-copper-wall-north.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b8/Plaque-fancy-copper-wall-north.png/50px-Plaque-fancy-copper-wall-north.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Plaque\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Plaque\">Placa ornamental</a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Resonator\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Resonator\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/93/Resonator.png/25px-Resonator.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/93/Resonator.png/38px-Resonator.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/93/Resonator.png/50px-Resonator.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"100\" data-file-height=\"100\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Resonator\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Resonator\">Ressonador</a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Night_vision_mask\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Night vision mask\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/Nightvisiondevice.png/25px-Nightvisiondevice.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/Nightvisiondevice.png/38px-Nightvisiondevice.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ef/Nightvisiondevice.png/50px-Nightvisiondevice.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Night_vision_mask\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Night vision mask\">Máscara de visão noturna</a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Base_return_teleporter\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Base return teleporter\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/13/Basereturnteleporter.png/25px-Basereturnteleporter.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/13/Basereturnteleporter.png/38px-Basereturnteleporter.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/13/Basereturnteleporter.png/50px-Basereturnteleporter.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"100\" data-file-height=\"100\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Base_return_teleporter\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Base return teleporter\">Teletransportador de base de retorno</a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Terminus_teleporter\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Terminus teleporter\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/82/Corpsereturnteleporter.png/25px-Corpsereturnteleporter.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/82/Corpsereturnteleporter.png/38px-Corpsereturnteleporter.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/82/Corpsereturnteleporter.png/50px-Corpsereturnteleporter.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Terminus_teleporter\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Terminus teleporter\">Teletransportador terminal</a></li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Alloys\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ligas\">Ligas</span></h3>\n<p>O chumbo é usado para molibdochalkos, em uma proporção de 8-12% <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/copper\">cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span> para 88-92% de chumbo. Placas Molybdochalkos podem ser usadas para fazer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Light_sources#Lanterns\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Light sources\">lampiãos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Light_sources#Lanterns\" title=\"Light sources\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p>O chumbo também pode ser ligado em lingotes de solda de chumbo, numa proporção de 45-55% de chumbo para 45-55% <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/tin\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/tin\">estanho</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tin\" title=\"Tin\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Minérios, metais e minerais</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Guias</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits/pt-br\" title=\"Ore Deposits/pt-br\">Depósitos de minério</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits/pt-br\" title=\"Ore Deposits/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Metal/pt-br\" title=\"Metal/pt-br\">Metais</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal/pt-br\" title=\"Metal/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Metais</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Copper/pt-br\" title=\"Copper/pt-br\">Cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper/pt-br\" title=\"Copper/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Iron/pt-br\" title=\"Iron/pt-br\">Ferro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Iron/pt-br\" title=\"Iron/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Meteoric_iron/pt-br\" title=\"Meteoric iron/pt-br\">Ferro meteórico</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meteoric_iron/pt-br\" title=\"Meteoric iron/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Gold/pt-br\" title=\"Gold/pt-br\">Ouro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Gold/pt-br\" title=\"Gold/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Silver/pt-br\" title=\"Silver/pt-br\">Prata</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Silver/pt-br\" title=\"Silver/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Chumbo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Tin/pt-br\" title=\"Tin/pt-br\">Estanho</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tin/pt-br\" title=\"Tin/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Zinc/pt-br\" title=\"Zinc/pt-br\">Zinco</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Zinc/pt-br\" title=\"Zinc/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Bismuth/pt-br\" title=\"Bismuth/pt-br\">Bismuto</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bismuth/pt-br\" title=\"Bismuth/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Titanium/pt-br\" title=\"Titanium/pt-br\">Titânio (Ilmenita)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Titanium/pt-br\" title=\"Titanium/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Nickel/pt-br\" title=\"Nickel/pt-br\">Níquel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Nickel/pt-br\" title=\"Nickel/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Ligas</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Bronze/pt-br\" title=\"Bronze/pt-br\">Bronze</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze/pt-br\" title=\"Bronze/pt-br\"> </a></span> (bronze de estanho, bronze de bismuto, bronze preto) • <a href=\"/Steel/pt-br\" title=\"Steel/pt-br\">Aço</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Steel/pt-br\" title=\"Steel/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Brass/pt-br\" title=\"Brass/pt-br\">Latão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Brass/pt-br\" title=\"Brass/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Solder\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Solder\">Solda</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Solder\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Solder\"> </a></span> (Solda de chumbo, solda de prata) • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Molybdochalkos\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Molybdochalkos\">Molibdocalco</a><span s